  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "書法的臨摹與應用",
    "sub_ename": "MIMICKING AND APPLICATION OF CALLIGRAPHY",
    "describe_ch": "藉由歷代書法名作的賞析，感受情性的抒發與提升美感的素養。透過書法名作的臨摹，而擁有處理書法元素的能力，並且萃取其中的精華，厚植個人文創的能量。\r\n本課程的期末目標是設定主題，完成書法作品，並邀請名家進行觀摩展。學生可藉由觀摩展擴大視野，了解自己的不足，而加以改進。其完成的作品可裝飾學校環境，增進生活的情趣。\r\n",
    "describe_eh": "The course aims to experience the release of the emotion and elevate the literacy of aesthetic perception by appreciating famous calligraphy works of the past. Mimicking famous works can enhance students’ capability of maneuvering their brush and learn the skills for calligraphy as well as cultivate the energy for personal creativity. The goal of the course is to set up themes and finish certain works. We also invite masters to hold an exhibition so that students can broaden their horizons and improve what they lack. The works they created can also be used as decorations on campus.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 2.0
  },
  "targets": [
    {
      "seq": 1,
      "describe_ch": "引導學生理解漢字造型美感,並能完成屬於自己的書法作品。",
      "describe_en": "Guide students to understand the beauty of the style of calligraphy and can complete their own calligraphy works."
    },
    {
      "seq": 2,
      "describe_ch": "體會運筆的流暢與協調，並從中自覺身體放鬆與書寫的樂趣。",
      "describe_en": "Experience the smoothness and coordination of the pen movement, and consciously relax the body and the pleasure of writing."
    }
  ],
